{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34719","headline":"晓起即事因成回文寄袭美 · 陆龟蒙","name":"晓起即事因成回文寄袭美","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平波落月吟闲景，暗幌浮烟思起人。\n清露晓垂花谢半，远风微动蕙抽新。\n城荒上处樵童小，石藓分来宿鹭驯。\n晴寺野寻同去好，古碑苔字细书匀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34719.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34719","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}